{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A particle is placed on the parabola <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa12669a9636f539590cf86034656ef7bec6b26c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^2- x -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" /> at a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> whose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. It is allowed to roll along the parabola until it reaches the nearest point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> whose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/3683f227b0b53e6a30087db2fa3b752965ecf05d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-6$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />. The horizontal distance traveled by the particle (the numerical value of the difference in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />) is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/c/c5c1d16759070d0595159889a5a1846606a0b97d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf07d9f0a2413768e291d1264b59b3c835e4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> in the equation of the parabola gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d29f1e8156c773ba0a81c88d801237f333a932ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x-6=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/5/d1541b02bca0c7d35ab0d9a9ad759b0b5bf5e755.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x-12=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />, which factors as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/1/c91eb09f04c4881dd805d69675680ec8fbe5ad2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-4)(x+3)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc52914d6fade6cb0f0f830a05d31585700f7ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6f8dc90670a02c1ee3f61d17da8f5e6e19d705.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/e/55e3f6584c4fc7c350e0f82d9f5fb462d726ab5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x-6=-6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9b21cd3a1e537f64853bbd839e68a1f521185e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x=0$\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />, which factors as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/682846a162df12667105e7da42c55d5956baf907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The parabola has its vertex at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/2271f2279e7fb7d56effe22a9369a2cc09e27872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\tfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"47\" height=\"23\" />, which is the point of minimum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-value. Since the particle rolls continuously along the curve, it cannot jump past the vertex; so starting from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/0/c601e30469aefa48e2d3184cddc9c0c551cafbd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P=(4,6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />, it first reaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6f8dc90670a02c1ee3f61d17da8f5e6e19d705.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/e/89ec50400f15dc967ad563a1d6d68d8ca330a04b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q=(1,-6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />, a horizontal distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d52a85b257a993d399067b367c087271f27d97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4-1=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />. Likewise, starting from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f038f748871797e6f48992753d831e1b77ce9a9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P=(-3,6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />, it first reaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6f8dc90670a02c1ee3f61d17da8f5e6e19d705.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/3/793c0ad329490199c10d80a9bc9131db76d125fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q=(0,-6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />, again a horizontal distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the horizontal distance traveled is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44eb511c4f725b6b8f6c6a941d77324031885652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a hr